What is the recommended daily intake for each nutrient category to ensure optimal health and nutrition? Can you provide a JSON data example of a balanced diet that includes all necessary nutrients in the right proportions?
Here is an example of a JSON data object for a balanced diet:
{
  "fruits": {
    "name": "Fruits",
    "servings": 2,
    "nutrients": {
      "vitamin C": "100%",
      "fiber": "10%",
      "carbohydrates": "15%"
    }
  },
  "vegetables": {
    "name": "Vegetables",
    "servings": 3,
    "nutrients": {
      "vitamin A": "100%",
      "vitamin K": "10%",
      "fiber": "15%"
    }
  },
  "grains": {
    "name": "Grains",
    "servings": 6,
    "nutrients": {
      "carbohydrates": "60%",
      "fiber": "20%",
      "iron": "10%"
    }
  },
  "protein": {
    "name": "Protein",
    "servings": 3,
    "nutrients": {
      "protein": "30%",
      "iron": "10%",
      "zinc": "10%"
    }
  },
  "dairy": {
    "name": "Dairy",
    "servings": 3,
    "nutrients": {
      "calcium": "30%",
      "vitamin D": "10%",
      "protein": "15%"
    }
  },
  "fats": {
    "name": "Fats",
    "servings": 2,
    "nutrients": {
      "healthy fats": "10%",
      "omega-3 fatty acids": "10%",
      "vitamin E": "5%"
    }
  }
}
Can you explain how this JSON data object provides a balanced diet that includes all necessary nutrients in the right proportions?

